<main id="game-main">
  <header class="gl-header">
    <div><h1>Great Lakes <span>Map Challenge</span></h1><p class="gl-intro">24 places. Find them. Build your streak.</p></div>
    <div class="gl-header-controls"><button id="sound-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Sound effects on; click to mute"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9h4l5-4v14l-5-4H4zM17 8c2 2 2 6 0 8m3-11c4 4 4 10 0 14"/></svg><span>Sound on</span></button><div class="gl-modes" aria-label="Game mode"><button type="button" id="play-mode" aria-pressed="true">Play</button><button type="button" id="study-mode" aria-pressed="false">Explore</button></div></div>
  </header>
  <noscript><p>This game needs JavaScript. Enable it in your browser, then reload the page.</p></noscript>
  <div id="gl-app" hidden>
    <div class="gl-layout">
      <section class="gl-panel" aria-label="Current question">
        <div class="gl-scoreboard"><div><strong id="points">0</strong><span>points</span></div><div><strong id="streak">0</strong><span>streak</span></div></div>
        <div class="gl-progress-label"><span id="round-label">Full map</span><span id="progress-text"></span></div>
        <progress id="round-progress" value="0" max="24" aria-label="Places completed"></progress>
        <div id="question-area"><h2 id="place-name" tabindex="-1"></h2><p class="gl-category" id="place-category"></p></div>
        <p id="feedback" class="gl-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
        <div class="gl-actions"><button type="button" id="reveal">Reveal this place</button><button type="button" id="next" hidden>Keep going <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button type="button" id="retry" hidden>Replay missed places</button><button type="button" id="restart" hidden>Play all 24 again</button></div>
        <form id="number-form"><label for="map-number">Or answer by number</label><div class="gl-entry"><input id="map-number" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" max="24" step="1" required autocomplete="off" aria-label="Map number"><button type="submit">Go</button></div></form>
        <p id="score" class="gl-score"></p><p class="gl-low-stakes">100 points on your first try. 50 after a miss.<br>Untimed. Your score stays in this round.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="gl-map-section" aria-label="Great Lakes map">
        <div class="gl-mobile-status"><div><strong id="mobile-prompt"></strong><p id="mobile-feedback"></p></div><button id="mobile-next" type="button" hidden>Next →</button></div>
        <div class="gl-map-toolbar"><div class="gl-zoom"><button type="button" id="zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><span id="zoom-level">1×</span><button type="button" id="zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button><button type="button" id="zoom-reset">All lakes</button></div><div class="gl-details-zoom" aria-label="Zoom to a detail"><button type="button" data-detail="chicago">Chicago</button><button type="button" data-detail="detroit">Detroit</button><button type="button" data-detail="niagara">Niagara</button></div></div>
        <div class="gl-map-wrap"><div id="map-celebration" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="gl-map-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Map. Drag or scroll to pan; use zoom buttons for detail. Arrow keys pan the map.">
          <svg id="lakes-map" viewBox="0 0 1000 660" aria-label="Numbered Great Lakes identification map"><g id="lake-shapes" aria-hidden="true"></g><g id="city-shapes" aria-hidden="true"></g><g id="channel-shapes" aria-hidden="true"></g><g id="map-markers"></g></svg>
        </div><div class="gl-map-north" aria-label="North is up"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 42" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 40V15m-6 6 6-6 6 6"/><text x="10" y="10" text-anchor="middle">N</text></svg></div><div class="gl-scale"><span id="scale-rule"></span><span id="scale-label"></span></div></div>
        <div class="gl-map-bottom"><div class="gl-legend"><span><i class="gl-water-swatch"></i>Water</span><span><i class="gl-city-swatch"></i>City limits</span><span><i class="gl-canal-swatch"></i>Canal / seaway</span></div><p>Every number sits on its feature. Zoom in to separate nearby places.</p></div>
        <details class="gl-map-details"><summary>Map sources &amp; geography</summary><p>Lake shores, municipal boundaries, rivers, and canal centerlines: © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/">ODbL</a>. Retrieved September 2026. North-up equirectangular projection, standard parallel 45° N; scale is approximate at 45° N. City outlines show municipal limits, which can include water. The Fox River shown is the lower Wisconsin river leading to Green Bay. Canal and seaway numbers locate one point on a longer route. <a href="../features/great-lakes-game-SOURCES.md">Source details</a>.</p></details>
      </section>
    </div>
    <section id="study-index" class="gl-study-index" hidden aria-label="Study list"><h2>Explore the connections.</h2><p>Choose a place to zoom straight to it. Your game will wait.</p><div id="study-list"></div></section>
  </div>
</main>
